  "_comment": "Reader comments' word lists and links (#524, docs/design/reader-comments.md 4.2, 5.4, 11.4). The API applies them (api/discussion_rules.go: matchDiscussionWord, readerCommentLinks, matchesMemberName); the admin's preview and the renderer use the twins in web/src/lib/discussion.ts. Both suites run every case. `words` cases give the list and the text, and `match` is the entry found (null for none). `links` cases give the text and the links as the renderer links them. `member_names` cases give a guest name, the members, and whether it matches one.",
